                                "example_id": "3db14eac-07ca-44a7-a7c6-02978f5bf627",
                                "sense_id": "14840b3c-d1ba-3a5c-9128-d961fa803f34",
                                "text": "Now no more of winters biting,\nFilth in trench from fall to spring,\nSummers full of sweat and fighting\nFor the Kesar or the King."
